<h3><u>Kya andhera</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Haay<br />
Aye phuphi amma - 3<br />
Aye phuphi amma meri - 4</p>

<p>Kya andhera hai phuphi - 2</p>

<p>Qaidkhane me sakina ka tha nauha aye phuphi<br />
Kya andhera hai phuphi - 2</p>

<p>Ek shama mangwaiye ke ho ujala aye phuphi<br />
Kya andhera hai phuphi - 2</p>

<p>1. God me apni chupalo dil dhadakta hai mera<br />
Har ghadi lagta hai jaise shimr fir se aa gaya<br />
Paas se mere nahi jaana khudara aye phuphi</p>

<p>2. Khauf aata hai phuphi din ke ujaale me yaha<br />
Wehshate hi wehshate hai qaidkhane me yaha<br />
Ek pal lagta nahi hai dil hamara aye phuphi</p>

<p>3. Ab kaha baba ka seena chayn ki raate kaha<br />
Ab kaha wo din rahe wo pyaar ki baate kaha<br />
Aayenge kab laut ke wo din dubara aye phuphi</p>

<p>4. Haa abhi kuch der pehle mujko neend aayi to thi<br />
Chand lamho baad firse aankh meri khul gayi<br />
Yu laga jaise ho baba ne pukara aye phuphi</p>

<p>5. Aaye baba to sunau mai sitam ki daastaan<br />
Mai dikhaaungi rasan ke aur tamacho ke nishan<br />
Sun nahi paayenge baba haal saara aye phuphi</p>
</p>
